FAQs
Q: What if I don't receive the verification code?
Check your spam folder and wait two minutes before requesting a resend. If it still doesn't arrive, contact [IT Support](https://support.microsoft.com/contactus).
Q: What if I no longer have access to my registered phone or backup email?
Self-service reset isn't possible without a verification channel. Open a ticket with IT Support so they can verify your identity manually.

